  "$comment": "How a reader cleans text (spec: Text). rule: line (titles, names, author.name, license, generator), description (the list's and a link's), tag. max: the field's limit in characters (Unicode scalar values). out: the cleaned text, or null for none. Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.",
